# Pairs with AckedWriteDurable. The write is acknowledged when its flush is
# issued rather than when it lands, so an acknowledged write is not in the store.
MODULE: AckedWriteDurableAckBeforeFlush
TARGET: AckedWriteDurable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the acknowledgement point precedes durability
PERTURBS: FlushAck

--- FIND
    /\ durable' = durable \cup {o}
    /\ acked' = acked \cup {o}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: acknowledged without being stored.
    /\ durable' = durable
    /\ acked' = acked \cup {o}
--- END